optimized_instructions.dataflow_inspector:
Carefully inspect the code script to identify every line that directly references or operates on the target column (reads it, writes it, filters on it, transforms it, merges it, or accesses it via indexing, attributes, or iterators like itertuples).

Verify that the target column name actually appears or is referenced on each identified line. Do not include lines that operate on unrelated columns or intermediate variables before the target column is accessed. Use 1-based line numbers matching the script exactly; merge contiguous lines into a single range [start_line, end_line].

Output only JSON: { "sources": [{ "start_line": int, "end_line": int }, ...] }

